Pursuant to the provisions of O.C.G.A. § 8-2-3(e), new construction in the unincorporated areas of the county and the repair and renovation of existing buildings in the unincorporated areas of the county will be exempt from the requirements of O.C.G.A. § 8-2-3(c) where one or more of the following conditions are met:
(1) When the repair or renovation of the existing building does not include the replacement of the plumbing or sewage system servicing toilets, faucets, or shower heads within such existing building;
